BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Asheville
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T113000
DTSTAMP:20260917T172425Z
CREATED:20260916T171237Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260917T172425Z
UID:10005331-1790418600-1790422200@uuasheville.org
SUMMARY:Blue Ridge Pride Interfaith Worship
DESCRIPTION:Join Us for Interfaith Pride Worship before the 2026 Blue Ridge Pride Festival in Asheville!\n\nALL are welcome—invited\, encouraged\, and celebrated. Come as you are. Let’s worship and celebrate together. \n\n\nAs part of 2026 Blue Ridge Pride Festival\, we’re honored to join with other local faith communities to co-host a special Interfaith Pride Worship Service on Saturday\, September 26 at 10:30 am at Central United Methodist Church in Downtown Asheville.\nThis inclusive\, affirming service will be a joyful celebration of love\, justice\, and spiritual unity across traditions. Together\, we will reflect\, sing\, and stand in solidarity with our LGBTQ+ siblings\, honoring the sacred worth of all people.\nFollowing the service\, we will fellowship and process together to the Blue Ridge Pride Festival\, continuing our witness of welcome and belonging for all.
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/blue-ridge-pride-interfaith-worship-2026/
LOCATION:Central United Methodist Church\, 27 Church St\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:**Worship - LITURGY,*Justice Ministry - LIBERATION,*Newcomer-Friendly - LOVING,Featured Upcoming,Other
ORGANIZER;CN="Rev. Audette Fulbright Fulson":MAILTO:RevAudette@UUAsheville.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Asheville
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T091500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T100000
DTSTAMP:20260923T011151Z
CREATED:20260923T011052Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923T011151Z
UID:10006039-1790500500-1790503200@uuasheville.org
SUMMARY:9:15 Contemplative Service
DESCRIPTION:At 9:15 AM\, we have a 40-45 minute Contemplative Worship Service. This service invites participants into a reflective\, more meditative space\, and includes silence\, beautiful recorded music and videos\, and opportunities for sharing. It also features the sermon and theme which will be the focus in the second service at 11:15 AM. This service is not livestreamed.\, and it include childcare but not a full religious education program. This service will be particularly good if you need quiet in order to hear well or focus\, would prefer a little more space around you\, or seek a more contemplative communal experience. \nBetween services\, at 10 am we will have coffee hour and special programs. Whether you come to the early service or the later service\, we encourage you to consider arriving at 10 am for coffee\, conversation\, and special programs including conversations with the Board\, or Minister & lay-led justice or adult education offerings.
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/915-contemplative-service-2026-2027-waging-peace-09-27-2026-3/
LOCATION:*1 Sanctuary\, 1 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:**Sunday AM - LITURGY,**Worship - LITURGY
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/09-27-2026-Waging-Peace-1600x900-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Rev. Audette Fulbright Fulson":MAILTO:RevAudette@UUAsheville.org
END:VEVENT
