BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Unitarian Universalist Congregation of Asheville
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T111500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T121500
DTSTAMP:20260923T005618Z
CREATED:20260923T003338Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260923T005618Z
UID:10006111-1790507700-1790511300@uuasheville.org
SUMMARY:11:15 Traditional Service
DESCRIPTION:At 11:15 AM\, we have our Traditional Service. This service includes our choir or special guest musicians\, Wisdom story\, our regular children’s religious education classes and childcare\, and is livestreamed. \nAfter the 11:15 service\, folx are welcome to remain for a social time\, enjoying coffee (if coffee remains after the 10 AM coffee hour*!) and conversation. Groups and teams who meet after our 11 AM service time are still welcome to schedule and meet – though space permitting\, 10 AM will be a good time to consider meeting\, as well. \n*Please note: Between services\, at 10 AM\, we have coffee hour and special programs. Whether you come to the early service or the later service\, we encourage you to consider arriving at 10 AM for coffee\, conversation\, and special programs including conversations with the Board\, or Minister & lay-led justice or adult education offerings. 
URL:https://uuasheville.org/event/1115-traditional-service-2026-2027-waging-peace-09-27-2026/
LOCATION:*1 Sanctuary\, 1 Edwin Place\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801\, United States
CATEGORIES:**Sunday AM - LITURGY,**Worship - LITURGY
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://uuasheville.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/09-27-2026-Waging-Peace-1600x900-1.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Rev. Audette Fulbright Fulson":MAILTO:RevAudette@UUAsheville.org
END:VEVENT
